{"id":"en_the-heiress-demands-blood","title":"The Heiress Demands Blood","titleEn":"The Heiress Demands Blood","description":"After her father pushed her mother to suicide and immediately brought his mistress into the family mansion, an heiress hides her intentions behind the role of a dutiful daughter while quietly plotting a merciless payback. She joins forces with a brilliant lawyer to bring down her poisonous relatives and take back the empire that was taken from her. Amid the conflict and vengeance, she also faces the question of whether genuine love can still find a place in her life.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-heiress-demands-blood/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-heiress-demands-blood/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family Drama","Female Empowerment","Revenge"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtdek/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-heiress-demands-blood_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtdek/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-heiress-demands-blood_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtdek/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-heiress-demands-blood_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtdek/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-heiress-demands-blood_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dtdek/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_th